    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "There are 9 identical pieces of ribbon, each $\\frac{7}{20}$ metres long.\n\nThe 9 pieces of ribbon are placed end to end. What is the total length of the ribbon?\n\nGive your answer as a mixed number.",
    "layout": "list",
